Package: authlas
Title: Authentication and Access Container for 'Shiny' and 'webR'
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R:
    person("Sergio", "Ciordia", email = "wardiam@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Sergio Ciordia [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Sergio Ciordia <wardiam@gmail.com>
Description: Authentication and access gate for 'Shiny' applications, with two
    deployment variants sharing one package: an external/no-login gate for apps
    running in the browser with 'webR' (identity delegated to a provider such as
    Auth0), and a local/server variant with credential login against a 'duckdb'
    user store, Argon2id password hashing and Pushover two-factor authentication.
    The authentication UI is built with Material UI. Originally derived from the
    'shinymanager' package (GPL-3).
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/sciordia/authlas
BugReports: https://github.com/sciordia/authlas/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    R6,
    shiny,
    htmltools,
    jsonlite,
    muiMaterial
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr,
    DBI,
    duckdb,
    sodium,
    openssl,
    pushoverr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
